    "created_at": "2017-09-25T20:46:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-25T20:46:29Z",
    "body": "FontFace and FontFaceSet are already exposed in workers.\r\n\r\nIt seems WorkerGlobalScope already implements FontFaceSource according to the spec [1].  But that spec says it's for \"CanvasProxy\" (the previous incarnation of OffscreenCanvas). LOL. Let's update that.\r\n\r\nSo I guess all we need to do as far the IDL is concerned is to add:\r\n```\r\nOffscreenCanvasRenderingContext2D implements CanvasTextMethods\r\nOffscreenCanvasRenderingContext2D implements CanvasTextDrawingStyles\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think the font size to CSS pixel unit conversions need to be better defined.\r\n\r\nThe prose that refers to the \"font style source object\" [2] needs to be special-cased for OffscreenCanvas,  since OffscreenCanvas objects have no style.\r\n\r\n[1] [https://drafts.csswg.org/css-font-loading/#font-face-source](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-font-loading/#font-face-source)\r\n[2] [https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#font-style-source-object](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#font-style-source-object)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
